        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(5a^2-1)^2$",
          "worked": "The squared terms are $(5a^2)^2$ and $1^2$. Check: $2\\times5a^2\\times1=10a^2$. The middle term is negative.\n$$25a^4-10a^2+1=(5a^2-1)^2$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 31
      },
      {
        "id": "p27-q6-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$16x^4+24x^2+9$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
